+
+Either form can be narrowed to the veterinarians holding one named specialty, requested through the address alone `[REQ-VET-003]`. The name matches a whole specialty name, disregarding letter case. A name no veterinarian holds yields an empty list, and a blank name means no filter. Neither form offers an on-page control for choosing a specialty.
 
 **Done when:**
 - `[REQ-VET-001]` given the clinic's veterinarians, when the directory is opened, then each name and its specialties are listed a page at a time.
